  "Product mapping table: website page <-> Bokun product <-> Mornby tour. One row per live vistachase.com product.",
  "bokunId: the Bokun experience (product) ID. Placeholder (null) until Vista Chase provides the IDs; fill each one in and reseed (npm run prisma:seed). Bokun API keys go in .env (BOKUN_*).",
