  "mornbyTour: the tour name in Mornby (mornby.com > Tours). mornbyMatch 'proposed' means matched by name and route and needs confirming by operations; 'none' means Mornby has no matching tour yet.",
  "places / season: used to pick each product's gallery photos from backend/media (see prisma/catalog/load-catalog.js).",
  "TICKET products (Banff activity tickets) are new: not on the live site, content in extra-products.json. They take requests (ENQUIRY) until their Bokun IDs exist; then set bookingMode to BOKUN."
